### Expected behaviour

"The UE can successfully re-register."
"Correct reference counting for the client."

### Observed Behaviour

When the UE re-registers, the UDM fails to send a message to the UDR due to an incorrect port .
The root cause is likely an issue with the client's reference count (ref).

